raph","text":"玲奈さんチーム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1サビをこの三人で踊ったんですが、ここだけ全員の振りと違ったので かずみんと私は居残りして 頑張って体に叩き入れました（　･`ω･´)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひゃー私にとっては今までしてきたダンスの中で一番難しかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと玲奈さんは撮影当日の早朝に振り入れ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流石としか言いようがないです(´◦ω◦`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブではどんな感じなるんだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サビの oh oh oh oh oh!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は皆さんも一緒にお願いします(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい聴いてねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/06/27/4555014/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2014/06/27/4555014/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若ちゃん誕生日♡おめでとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一つ大人になったね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度美味しいご飯とか食べに行こうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年20歳組の もう誕生日を迎えた せいらりんとななせと この間三人でご飯行ってきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエットだからと少食のななせの横でバクバクと二人で食べたよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break